/v/t64.5771-25/38974504_999332164037048_8352848161181583365_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wA9SJ5slIUoQ7kNvwFMhq1i&_nc_oc=AdptNLp0GbC7duYNQBcGuAcTrndBe75IhLF22SKmEBtmwH78HA3TAbbQKV0oXK1qjkA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5jDjYn1xsBozm1T9W5CVhy0ag_4nevAlpX4zSHmLkC3Q&oe=6A1706F9"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom2.png", "id": "1060903411489141", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031501_1060903414822474_9192607785681237416_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EIDrEYFN4vYQ7kNvwHQdhFT&_nc_oc=Adqqe2cSzWGpxF78rhwjbjJ325beNm3g-nXBisRA35vGtwzlRKJVzrhWuyNUUb4CNzM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6g6_4doHfNuhmd4mVRNoDN0ZFdzD36DqRb-pIBhKRMpw&oe=6A16E043"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom3.png", "id": "1333559243720099", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_1333559247053432_5526570972152141129_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_9pYdrBK9RYQ7kNvwHsit68&_nc_oc=Adqboh_bWuDE0qM0sU7JDtt4gAnLlAtxVLkW4bH12RANfnbtZ44PtNpV_CnY3frsRq4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6TxZ21iW_Bnu_rj4qRMkmNcvl6W9UAWEuIuTjBfXjpgw&oe=6A170F4E"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom4.png", "id": "403819987828479", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982552_403819991161812_8720327022213224385_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bfHcAdf6QzsQ7kNvwHG8JzP&_nc_oc=Adps24d2e15q3JAVp7Dvrc3UDp6Mz_bV7BEBQ2_oFsbInm0tC0RiztnY0z5KTH2H6ug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7xOcJI4hl7WH-NgVvLIXNTq_bDd6AupPtXEeklq7layw&oe=6A16DF33"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom5.png", "id": "397854095192936", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982464_397854098526269_4581865977018394136_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5rIrjwjw-5cQ7kNvwG2NUoo&_nc_oc=Ado21O1sr6_wMkdTwVMxUsssiVuW4VQyFMzuPEBYk6qnDQ6xXXwoZJR5z1UC9j3Pcx0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6s1w60V0X1UmM30ognEaFdIf3XLKaiT7ZsrhP0GS0KAw&oe=6A1710BB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR-ME: Fire In The Engine Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In the script of the scenario \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb after some welding work in the engine room, a fire starts in the bilge of the engine room, also spreading to the main electrical panel.The \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app includes actions mentioned below that are urgent at the situation of fire:\n\n-Go to the meeting point. Recount\n\n-Grab, carry and put on \ufb01re \ufb01ghter equipment, prove function     and adjustment\n\n-Grab one \ufb01re extinguisher and put it ready for use.\n\n-Going to the engine control room and trying to su\ufb00ocate the \ufb01re, with a \ufb01re  extinguisher.                          \n\nThe development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project.", "short_description": "\u00abVR-ME: Fire in the Engine Room\u00bb app is about an emergency situation when you\u2019re working onboard a vessel that is out to sea, an engine fire is one of the last things you want to deal with.Engine room fires also obviously put a ship filled with maritime workers at risk of injury or death. The development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project."}]}, "developer_name": "SQLearn", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sqlearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "The consortium of the VR-ME project", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vr-me.eu/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating":